messages.text:
Ava: You defeated us so soundly
that even I feel refreshed!{be01}
Aya: I cheered as best I could...

Keeping track of wins and losses is
important, but don't lose sight of{be00}
everything else as a result!

Knowing what a truly heated
battle is all about is the key to{be00}
truly passionate cheering!{be01}
